te":"吳王之初發也，吳臣田祿伯為大將軍。田祿伯曰：「兵屯聚而西，無佗奇道，難以就功。臣願得五萬人，別循江淮而上，收淮南、長沙，入武關，與大王會，此亦一奇也。」吳王太子諫曰：「王以反為名，此兵難以藉人，藉人亦且反王，柰何？且擅兵而別，多佗利害，未可知也，徒自損耳。」吳王即不許田祿伯。"}],"interpretation_note":"依本文子、少子或所事王的太子稱謂保存父子；未記母親。被殺太子與起兵太子分存；少子、起兵太子、子華、子駒彼此是否同人仍待核，不以候選 ID 分立宣稱確證不同人物。 家族分支為候選分配槽，不作出生排行。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false}}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-shiji-106-wuwang","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-106","chapter_id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang","mention_count":1,"mention_ids":["c-shiji-106-wuwang:m013-0076"],"paragraph_ids":["c-shiji-106-wuwang:p013"],"table_cell_ids":[],"passage_count":1}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-shiji-106-wuwang"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"currently_annotated_mentions","included_kinds":["paragraph","table_cell"],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[{"id":"a-shiji106-005","subject_person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_CAC","predicate":"father","object_person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_CA","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang","source_id":"s-shiji-106-wuwang","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang:p013","quote":"吳王之初發也，吳臣田祿伯為大將軍。田祿伯曰：「兵屯聚而西，無佗奇道，難以就功。臣願得五萬人，別循江淮而上，收淮南、長沙，入武關，與大王會，此亦一奇也。」吳王太子諫曰：「王以反為名，此兵難以藉人，藉人亦且反王，柰何？且擅兵而別，多佗利害，未可知也，徒自損耳。」吳王即不許田祿伯。"}],"qualifiers":{"source_term":"吳王太子","historicity":"historical_tradition"},"interpretation_note":"依本文子、少子或所事王的太子稱謂保存父子；未記母親。被殺太子與起兵太子分存；少子、起兵太子、子華、子駒彼此是否同人仍待核，不以候選 ID 分立宣稱確證不同人物。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[{"connection":"father","parent_person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_CA","status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang","source_id":"s-shiji-106-wuwang","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang:p013","quote":"吳王之初發也